        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- ====================================================================
           SECTION 2: HOW STUFF WORKS (TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE PIPELINE)
           ==================================================================== -->
      <section id="how-it-works" class="space-y-8">
        
        <div class="border-b border-zinc-800 pb-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-sans-ui uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400 font-bold">01 / Engine Breakdown</span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white font-brand tracking-tight uppercase mt-1">
            HOW HOGAMEGATA WORKS
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 max-w-xl mt-1">
            A look under the hood at our ingestion pipeline, noise elimination filters, and instant search architecture.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 4-Step Pipeline Grid with 3D Depth (Monochrome) -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 perspective-container">
          
          <!-- Step 1 -->
          <div class="card-3d bg-zinc-950/90 border border-zinc-800/90 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-brand font-bold text-sm mb-4">
                01
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-brand uppercase tracking-wide">Multi-Store Ingestion</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                Automated scrapers continuously index horror releases across Steam tags, itch.io game jam collections, GOG catalogs, and independent retro databases.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-zinc-900 text-[11px] text-zinc-500 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-400"></span>
