                Built on Cloudflare edge workers with Turso/SQLite full-text indexing. Instant typo-tolerant search and live deal tracking across stores.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-zinc-900 text-[11px] text-zinc-500 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-400"></span>
              Real-time Deals & FTS5
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- ====================================================================
           SECTION 3: SUBGENRE CURATION SHOWCASE (INTERACTIVE 3D CARDS)
           ==================================================================== -->
      <section id="curation" class="space-y-8">
        
        <div class="border-b border-zinc-800 pb-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-sans-ui uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400 font-bold">02 / Curation Architecture</span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white font-brand tracking-tight uppercase mt-1">
            EVERY FLAVOR OF HORROR, CATALOGED
          </h2>
